WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:02,510
What do these pigeons do?

2
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:04,430
My mind is a pigeon fisher

3
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:07,030
You can talk to the pigeons and they will follow their path

4
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:09,230
Can search for abnormal areas for us in a wide range

5
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:10,750
Then we stay on the periphery

6
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:12,230
Can't we just let the pigeons find it?

7
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:14,150
I can't share their vows

8
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:16,150
Nor can they accurately recognize faces.

9
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:17,940
They can only come back and tell me

10
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,060
Where there is a lot of loss

11
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:20,500
The building is obscured by black objects

12
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:21,940
Or someone stopped for a long time

13
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:27,900
We have to set out on our own to confirm our goals.

14
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:41,660
If you find anything unusual, come back along the same route.

15
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:43,760
Don't go near the lost group

16
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,240
Don't fall inside the building either
